158
00:18:37,590 --> 00:18:41,590
想いだけが生きる全て 命を作るのは 願いを
With only feelings to keep me alive, what creates life is... My wish.

159
00:19:33,590 --> 00:19:37,590
囚われた太陽の輝く
Where the captive sun shines,

160
00:19:37,590 --> 00:19:41,590
不思議の国の音楽が好きだった頃
When I loved the music of Wonderland,

161
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:52,590
願いはきっと叶うと 叶うと信じてる
I believe that wishes will surely, surely come true.

162
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:57,590
欲しいおとぎ話を聞かせて
Tell me the fairy tales I yearn to hear.

163
00:19:57,590 --> 00:20:01,080
光の陰で
In the shadow of the light...

164
00:20:00,210 --> 00:20:02,540
いつか君が瞳に灯す愛の光が
Someday the light of love that you shine in your eyes

165
00:20:02,540 --> 00:20:04,490
時を超えて
will transcend time,

166
00:20:04,490 --> 00:20:06,990
滅び急ぐ世界の夢を
and surely destroy one of the dreams

167
00:20:06,990 --> 00:20:09,590
確実に一つ壊すだろう
of a world rushing toward ruin.

168
00:20:12,390 --> 00:20:15,190
躊躇いを飲み干して
Swallowing down all hesitation,

169
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:17,090
君が望むモノは何?
what is it that you desire?

170
00:20:17,090 --> 00:20:19,890
こんな欲深い憧れの行方に
In the path of such greedy yearning,

171
00:20:19,890 --> 00:20:22,290
儚い明日はあるの?
is there a transient tomorrow?

172
00:20:22,290 --> 00:20:25,890
子どもの頃夢に見てた 古の魔法のように
Like the ancient magic I dreamed of as a child,

173
00:20:25,890 --> 00:20:29,590
闇さえ砕く力で 微笑む君に会いたい
I want to meet you smiling with power that shatters even the darkness.

174
00:20:29,590 --> 00:20:33,290
怯えるこの手の中には 手折られた花の勇気
In these trembling hands lies the courage of a plucked flower;

175
00:20:33,290 --> 00:20:37,090
想いだけが頼る全て 光を呼び覚ます願い
feelings are all I rely on, a wish that awakens the light.

176
00:20:37,090 --> 00:20:40,890
いつか君も誰かの為に 強い力を望むのだろう
Someday you too will wish for great power for someone's sake.

177
00:20:40,890 --> 00:20:44,290
愛が胸を捉えた夜に 未知の言葉が生まれてくる
On a night when love captures the heart, unknown words are born.

178
00:20:44,290 --> 00:20:47,890
迷わずに行けるなら 心が砕けてもいいわ
If I can go without hesitation, even if my heart breaks, it's fine.

179
00:20:47,890 --> 00:20:51,590
いつも目の前の悲しみに 立ち向かうための 呪文が欲しい
I want a spell to face the sorrow always right before my eyes.

180
00:20:51,590 --> 00:20:55,290
君はまだ夢見る記憶 私は眠らない明日
You are still memories dreaming; I am a sleepless tomorrow.

181
00:20:55,290 --> 00:20:59,090
二人が出会う奇跡を 勝ち取る為に進むわ
I will press forward to win the miracle of our meeting.

182
00:21:00,090 --> 00:21:03,090
怯えるこの手の中には 手折られた花の刃
In these trembling hands lies the blade of a plucked flower;

183
00:21:03,090 --> 00:21:06,090
想いだけが生きる全て 心に振りかざす 願い
feelings are all that live, a wish brandished in my heart.

184
00:21:48,390 --> 00:21:52,090
サンドリオン
[Cendrillon]

185
00:22:00,290 --> 00:22:03,590
朝まで踊る 夢だけ見せて
Let me see only dreams, dancing until morning.

186
00:22:03,590 --> 00:22:07,090
時計の針が解く魔法を
The magic untied by the clock's hands—

187
00:22:07,090 --> 00:22:10,590
曖昧な指 誘う階段
ambiguous fingers invite me up the stairs,

188
00:22:10,590 --> 00:22:14,590
三段飛ばしに跳ねていく
bounding up three steps at a time.

189
00:22:15,090 --> 00:22:19,590
馬車の中で 震えていた
Trembling inside the carriage,

190
00:22:19,590 --> 00:22:24,090
歪んだ古着 めくりめく夜の舞踏
in tattered old clothes, through the spinning night ball.

191
00:22:28,090 --> 00:22:31,290
知らぬ顔を探す 囁くあの声が
Searching for an unfamiliar face, that whispering voice

192
00:22:31,290 --> 00:22:35,290
握り締めた刃 月夜突き刺したって
pierced the moonlit night with the blade I clenched tightly.

193
00:22:39,590 --> 00:22:43,590
皆し後つどう後ろ 笑み仮面に描いて
Gathered behind, drawing smiles on our masks,

194
00:22:43,590 --> 00:22:47,590
偽りのない一瞬さえ 裸で包む
wrapping even a fleeting moment of falsehood bare.

195
00:22:47,590 --> 00:22:54,590
ざわめく サブール
[Cendrillon]

196
00:23:07,590 --> 00:23:11,590
灰の中で 赤く
Glowing red in the ashes,

197
00:23:11,590 --> 00:23:15,590
溶けて混ざる ガラスの靴
the glass slipper melts and mixes in.

198
00:23:15,590 --> 00:23:20,090
今さら帰る 震えているの
Returning now, are you trembling?

199
00:23:20,090 --> 00:23:24,090
あなたが目をやる 時計
The clock where you cast your eyes—

200
00:23:24,090 --> 00:23:27,590
靴脱ぎ踊る スロープ抜けて
slipping off our shoes and dancing, slipping past the slope,

201
00:23:27,590 --> 00:23:34,590
望むまで伸びる 指の隙間で
through the gaps of fingers stretching as far as desired.

202
00:23:35,090 --> 00:23:39,090
少しずつ 朽ち付けて
Little by little, letting it decay,

203
00:23:39,090 --> 00:23:46,590
走る衝動 背骨抜けいく 絶望
the racing impulse pierces through the spine—despair.

204
00:23:48,090 --> 00:23:52,090
鐘は鳴らさないで あなたに膝まずき
Don't ring the bell; kneeling before you,

205
00:23:52,090 --> 00:23:59,090
まだダメと叫んだ 右手が突き刺す サヨナラ
my right hand shouting "not yet" pierces through—goodbye.

206
00:24:00,090 --> 00:24:06,590
消せない 一生分の香水にまとう秘密
A secret draped in an unforgettable lifetime's perfume,

207
00:24:06,590 --> 00:24:12,090
強い瞳 僕の残った仮面を溶かす
your strong eyes melt the mask I had left.

208
00:24:21,090 --> 00:24:25,090
今も耳に あの声が
Even now, that voice in my ears,

209
00:24:25,090 --> 00:24:32,090
突き刺さるの 遠い 呪文
piercing deep—a distant spell,

210
00:24:32,090 --> 00:24:37,090
捨てたグラス越し
through the discarded glass.

211
00:24:37,090 --> 00:24:44,090
光る月が 君に被せたベール
The shining moon places a veil over you.

212
00:24:47,090 --> 00:24:51,090
ドレスの裾で裂いて ティアラは投げ捨て
Tear the hem of the dress, throw away the tiara;

213
00:24:51,090 --> 00:25:00,090
見つめ合う瞳と瞳が 花火を放つ
eyes meeting eyes release fireworks.

214
00:25:00,436 --> 00:25:03,666
孤独な魂が 炎を上げ 光りあう
Lonely souls raise flames and shine together,

215
00:25:03,666 --> 00:25:06,946
その涙 救えないなら
if those tears cannot be saved,

216
00:25:10,716 --> 00:25:13,146
まるでひとり遊びのように
as if playing all alone,

217
00:25:13,326 --> 00:25:16,196
まれ今は あなたに宵しれて
right now, intoxicated by you,

218
00:25:19,566 --> 00:25:25,646
揺れる鼓動を 一つ一つを 刻み付けてたい
I want to carve every single beating pulse into my heart.

219
00:25:26,646 --> 00:25:30,446
とどまれ 熱く濡れて 打ち付ける高まりに
Stay, burning and wet, against this pounding surge—

220
00:25:31,846 --> 00:25:39,102
これ以上は 動けないよ まれペアにしてる
moving no more, as if paired up.

221
00:26:03,902 --> 00:26:08,602
そばにいても 離れたまま 一つになれない流星
Even when close, remaining apart, a shooting star that can't become one.

222
00:26:08,602 --> 00:26:12,602
アルビレオ
Albireo.

223
00:26:14,302 --> 00:26:17,602
アルビレオ
[Albireo]

224
00:26:26,902 --> 00:26:31,602
ああ 君が思うよりも 僕は君でいっぱいだ
Ah, I'm so much more full of you than you think.

225
00:26:31,602 --> 00:26:39,102
流星みたいなうつろいを 片時も離さず見たいの
I want to watch your meteor-like fickleness without looking away for even a moment.

226
00:26:39,602 --> 00:26:45,102
ああ 僕が思うよりも 君はずっとずっと遠い
Ah, you are much, much further away than I think.

227
00:26:45,102 --> 00:26:49,302
重なったように見える仕草 苦しくなるほどに美しいな
Gestures that look like they overlap are so beautiful they make my chest ache.

228
00:26:53,102 --> 00:26:59,102
君が好きで感情が 残らず夜空を飾っている
My feelings of "I like you" decorate the night sky completely.

229
00:26:59,102 --> 00:27:03,102
心がまだ言い訳を 愛だなんて呼びたくない
My heart still doesn't want to call this excuse "love".

230
00:27:03,102 --> 00:27:07,102
君は愛に浮かんだ アルビレオを この心奪ったまま
You, the Albireo floating in love, with this heart stolen away—

231
00:27:07,102 --> 00:27:14,102
いらないのなら返してよ 他に欲張もないけどさ
if you don't need it, give it back, even though I have no other greed.

232
00:27:14,102 --> 00:27:16,902
今の相ミスの流星橋が 清爽圏で燃えて
Burning in the stratosphere...

233
00:27:27,102 --> 00:27:30,902
そばにいても 離れたまま 一つになれない流星
Even when close, remaining apart, a shooting star that can't become one.

234
00:27:30,902 --> 00:27:35,102
アルビレオ
Albireo.

235
00:27:41,102 --> 00:27:47,602
何光年先で 輝いてる君に 君に恋をしたんだ
I fell in love with you, shining many light-years away.

236
00:27:47,602 --> 00:27:56,102
何光年先から 測れるほど君の光が眩しすぎて からだ
Your light is so dazzling, measurable from light-years away...

237
00:27:58,102 --> 00:28:04,102
君が好きで感情が それだけで星が回っている
With just my feelings of "I like you", the stars keep spinning.

238
00:28:04,102 --> 00:28:11,102
明日を生きる言い訳を 愛だなんて呼んでみたい
I want to try calling the excuse to live tomorrow "love".

239
00:28:12,602 --> 00:28:18,602
君は愛に浮かんだ アルビレオを この心奪ったまま
You, the Albireo floating in love, with this heart stolen away—

240
00:28:19,102 --> 00:28:25,102
いらないのなら返してよ 他に欲張もないけどさ
if you don't need it, give it back, even though I have no other greed.

241
00:28:25,102 --> 00:28:30,602
今の相ミスの流星橋が 清爽圏で燃えて
Burning in the stratosphere...

242
00:28:32,102 --> 00:28:38,102
そばにいても 離れたまま 一つになれない流星
Even when close, remaining apart, a shooting star that can't become one.

243
00:28:38,102 --> 00:28:45,102
君は愛の色 ざるビレオ この心焦がしたまま
You are the color of love, Albireo, scorching this heart—

244
00:28:46,102 --> 00:28:51,602
誰より近く 恋してて 孤独わけもないのにさ
loving closer than anyone, even though there's no loneliness.

245
00:28:52,602 --> 00:28:58,602
今も温度を超えたかなりが 君を好きと叫ぶ
Screaming "I love you" beyond temperature—

246
00:28:59,102 --> 00:29:07,102
離れてても 消えないまま 二つにならない二十歳 アルビレオ
A binary star that never becomes one, remaining unextinguished even apart, Albireo.

247
00:29:42,102 --> 00:29:45,102
星月夜
[Starry Night]

248
00:29:55,102 --> 00:30:00,102
子どもの頃 見上げた
Looking up when I was a child...

249
00:30:01,151 --> 00:30:05,711
夜の空に 想った
I thought of it in the night sky,

250
00:30:06,431 --> 00:30:13,931
あのひとつひとつに 誰かの願いがこもってる
that each and every one holds someone's wish.

251
00:30:18,611 --> 00:30:23,251
そのひとつが あなたで
That one of them is you,

252
00:30:24,351 --> 00:30:31,531
すぐ隣で 笑ってて 目隠しを止めれるなら
and if you're laughing right next to me, stopping the blinding veil,

253
00:30:32,611 --> 00:30:37,451
この一秒を 切り取って
cutting out this very second...

254
00:30:41,991 --> 00:30:46,451
欲しいよ 夜に
In the night I desire you so,

255
00:30:47,151 --> 00:30:51,651
ただあなたに 会いたい
I just want to see you.

256
00:30:52,451 --> 00:30:59,931
あなたの名前を 祈るようにそっと 何度も
Gently, like a prayer, over and over,

257
00:30:59,931 --> 00:31:04,551
抱きしめているよ
I'm holding your name close.

258
00:31:05,251 --> 00:31:07,831
抱きしめているよ
Holding it close...

259
00:31:10,031 --> 00:31:15,651
もう私も 大人ね 変わったこと 変わらないこと
I'm an adult now too. What has changed, what hasn't changed...

260
00:31:16,251 --> 00:31:27,591
止まらない時計の針が 冷たいうねりを刻んだ
The hands of the unstoppable clock carved a cold swell.

261
00:31:32,931 --> 00:31:37,051
でもあなたに 出会って
Yet, meeting you,

262
00:31:37,451 --> 00:31:42,651
日々の眩しさを 知って
I came to know the dazzle of each day,

263
00:31:43,051 --> 00:31:45,511
まだ少し怖いけど
though I'm still a bit scared,

264
00:31:45,951 --> 00:31:49,651
今生み出せる気がしてる
I feel like I can create it now.

265
00:31:52,851 --> 00:31:58,451
星降る 夜に 会いたい日が積もるばかり
On a starry night, days of longing just pile up.

266
00:32:02,451 --> 00:32:09,931
あなたの名前を 祈るようにそっと 何度も
Gently, like a prayer, over and over,

267
00:32:09,931 --> 00:32:14,651
抱きしめているよ
I'm holding your name close.

268
00:32:15,351 --> 00:32:24,651
高なる鼓動が 体を追い越していく
My racing heartbeat overtakes my body.

269
00:32:25,151 --> 00:32:30,651
私の名前を 特別にしてくれても
Even if you made my name special,

270
00:32:31,151 --> 00:32:41,551
今はただ抱きしめていたい いつも持ってるよ
right now I just want to hold you close, I'll always hold on to it.

271
00:32:42,351 --> 00:32:48,451
悴んだ手に 温もり
Warmth in numb hands...

272
00:32:54,351 --> 00:33:02,651
目を閉じて その先へ
Close your eyes and head beyond.

273
00:33:06,251 --> 00:33:11,551
星降る 夜に
On a starry night,

274
00:33:11,951 --> 00:33:15,451
ただあなたに 会いたい
I just want to see you.

275
00:33:15,951 --> 00:33:23,551
あなたの名前を 祈るようにそっと 何度も
Gently, like a prayer, over and over,

276
00:33:23,551 --> 00:33:27,651
抱きしめているよ
I'm holding your name close.

277
00:33:27,951 --> 00:33:33,551
高なる鼓動で
With a racing heartbeat...

278
00:33:34,151 --> 00:33:39,551
裸のまま かけていく
running forth just as I am.

279
00:33:39,551 --> 00:33:44,951
私の名前を 特別にしてくれたの
You made my name special.

280
00:33:45,351 --> 00:33:50,951
あなたが 照らし続けてる
You keep on illuminating it.

281
00:33:52,451 --> 00:34:00,651
星降る 夜に
On a starry night...

282
00:34:35,951 --> 00:34:39,151
ぜいぜいせっせっ うーんずィーイェガー
Sie sind das Essen? Nein, wir sind der Jäger!

283
00:34:39,151 --> 00:34:41,351
Feuerroter Pfeil und Bogen.

284
00:34:50,251 --> 00:34:54,951
踏まれた花の 名前も知らずに
Not knowing the name of the trampled flower,

285
00:34:55,351 --> 00:35:00,115
地に墜ちた鳥は 風を待ち焦がれる
the fallen bird yearns for the wind.

286
00:35:00,130 --> 00:35:00,807
Seid ihr das Essen?

287
00:35:00,807 --> 00:35:01,207
Nein, wir sind der Jäger!

288
00:35:01,507 --> 00:35:03,247
踏みまれた花の 名前も知らずに

289
00:35:03,247 --> 00:35:06,187
地に墜ちた鳥は 風を待ち焦がれる

290
00:35:06,187 --> 00:35:08,707
祈ったところで 何も変わらない

291
00:35:08,707 --> 00:35:11,307
《今》を変えるのは 戦う覚悟だ

292
00:35:11,887 --> 00:35:13,767
屍踏み越えて 進む意志を 嗤う豚よ

293
00:35:13,767 --> 00:35:17,027
家畜の安寧 虚偽の繁栄

294
00:35:17,027 --> 00:35:19,587
死せば餓狼の《自由》を!

295
00:35:20,287 --> 00:35:22,587
囚われた屈辱は 反撃の嚆矢だ

