What color is your soul?

423
00:45:21,166 --> 00:45:27,366
燃えそびれたままで 捨ててほど逃げ出すほど
Leaving things half-burnt, wanting to run away so badly...

424
00:45:27,366 --> 00:45:30,366
強くないよ
I'm not that strong.

425
00:45:31,166 --> 00:45:39,666
ほら もう一度 ことばかなる なみかただしか なんて わからないけど
Look, once again... I don't know what's right or true with these words.

426
00:45:41,166 --> 00:45:45,666
形のないものばかりが
Only things without shape

427
00:45:45,666 --> 00:45:48,966
大切になっていく
Keep becoming so precious.

428
00:45:49,166 --> 00:45:53,166
散々巡り 重ならない
Wandering endlessly, overlapping words

429
00:45:53,166 --> 00:45:59,366
言葉だけが強く結ばれてる
Are the only things strongly bound together.

430
00:46:00,966 --> 00:46:05,666
またつまずいて転がって それでも砕けない
Tripping and rolling over, yet never shattering—

431
00:46:06,166 --> 00:46:10,166
魂の色は何色ですか
What color is your soul?

432
00:46:10,666 --> 00:46:15,666
ただ傷ついて強くなって それでも見つけたいよ
Just getting hurt and growing stronger, yet I still want to find it—

433
00:46:16,166 --> 00:46:20,666
魂の形確かめてるよ
I'm making sure of the shape of my soul.

434
00:46:31,666 --> 00:46:37,666
深海の底でひとり 扉と鍵を探す
Alone at the bottom of the deep sea, searching for a door and a key.

435
00:46:38,666 --> 00:46:42,666
言いわけは ほら 泡のように全部消え去って
Look, excuses vanish entirely like bubbles.

436
00:46:42,666 --> 00:46:48,166
鼓動を残して 残像だけ
Leaving behind only a heartbeat, an afterimage—

437
00:46:49,166 --> 00:46:54,666
次のページへ 伸びてく枝は離れてく
Growing toward the next page, branches parting ways.

438
00:46:54,666 --> 00:47:00,166
それぞれの道を行く
Each walking their own path.

439
00:47:00,966 --> 00:47:06,666
何重にも罪と寂しさを置いてだけが
Leaving layers of sin and loneliness behind,

440
00:47:06,666 --> 00:47:10,966
