Only roots grow deep and strong.

441
00:47:13,966 --> 00:47:19,166
また貫いて釘が刺さって それでもくじけない
Pierced and spiked through, yet refusing to break—

442
00:47:19,666 --> 00:47:24,166
心はどこに 伏線はどこに
Where is the heart? Where is the foreshadowing?

443
00:47:24,366 --> 00:47:29,966
ただ残されて抜け落ちて それでも伝えたいよ
Left behind and falling away, yet I still want to convey it—

444
