Is it a blue color?

449
00:48:26,666 --> 00:48:32,166
魂の色は何色ですか
What color is your soul?

450
00:48:36,166 --> 00:48:41,166
太めな過去に 太めな下に 生きるあなたは
Living in a thick past, under a thick foundation—what about you?

451
00:48:41,666 --> 00:48:45,666
何色ですか
What color are you?

452
00:48:47,166 --> 00:48:51,666
またつまずいて転がって それでも砕けない
Tripping and rolling over, yet never shattering—

453
00:48:52,166 --> 00:48:56,666
魂の色は何色ですか
What color is your soul?

454
00:48:57,166 --> 00:49:02,166
ただ傷ついて強くなって それでも見つけたいよ
Just getting hurt and growing stronger, yet I still want to find it—

455
00:49:02,166 --> 00:49:06,166
魂の形確かめてるよ
I'm making sure of the shape of my soul.

456
00:49:07,166 --> 00:49:27,666
ずっと…
Forever...

457
00:49:40,966 --> 00:49:45,166
その胸にしまった火に憧れた
I longed for the fire hidden in that chest.

458
00:49:45,166 --> 00:49:49,666
飲み込まれて消されされてしまいそうで
It felt like it would be swallowed up and extinguished.

459
00:49:50,166 --> 00:49:54,166
夕焼けみたいに暖かくて
Warm like a sunset,

460
00:49:54,166 --> 00:49:58,666
寂しくって強かったその日に
Lonely yet strong, on that day—

461
00:49:59,166 --> 00:50:00,166
言葉選んで
Choosing my words...

462
00:50:00,527 --> 00:50:03,027
手探り間違えた　よく晴れた日を
The bright, sunny day when I fumbled and made a mistake,

463
00:50:03,227 --> 00:50:06,087
いまだに思い出す
I still remember it to this day.

464
00:50:06,847 --> 00:50:11,907
目を伏せたらもう　動けなくて
When I cast my eyes down, I could no longer move,

465
00:50:12,067 --> 00:50:16,407
嫌われていないこと祈るばかりさ
Just praying that I wasn't hated.

466
00:50:16,927 --> 00:50:21,507
心全部見せてくれた
You showed me your whole heart,

467
00:50:21,507 --> 00:50:25,747
何ひとつ出来なかったのに
even though I couldn't do a single thing.

468
00:50:26,347 --> 00:50:30,087
どんな今を生きていますか
What kind of present are you living in now?

469
00:50:30,547 --> 00:50:34,167
好きだった歌はまだ聞こえますか
Can you still hear the songs you loved?

470
00:50:34,707 --> 00:50:39,007
くしゃみひとつで笑った横顔
Your profile when you smiled at a single sneeze,

471
00:50:39,327 --> 00:50:44,567
離れてもそばにいる　綺麗でいるよ
Even when apart, you're by my side, staying beautiful.

472
00:50:52,607 --> 00:50:56,427
口実だけで繋いだ　知らないで
Connected only by pretexts, without knowing,

473
00:50:56,727 --> 00:51:00,587
それでも離さない一人は怖い
Even so, being the only one not letting go is scary.

474
00:51:01,027 --> 00:51:05,167
疲れた勢いか　いろんなことが
Driven by exhaustion, all sorts of things

475
00:51:05,367 --> 00:51:10,147
奇跡みたいに思えて　どうしようもない
Felt like a miracle, leaving me completely helpless.

476
00:51:10,347 --> 00:51:14,167
少しずつ感じなくなっていく
Little by little, I stopped feeling it,

477
00:51:14,347 --> 00:51:18,427
悔しかった帰り道　忘れていく
Forgetting the way home wrapped in regret.

478
00:51:18,627 --> 00:51:22,767
そうしなきゃだめな　時が来る
A time must come when I have to do just that,

479
00:51:23,027 --> 00:51:27,607
それでも寂しくないこともある
Yet sometimes, I don't feel lonely at all.

480
00:51:27,947 --> 00:51:33,867
黙ったままの指切り　何が分からないか分からないまま
Remaining silent with pinky promises, not knowing what I don't understand.

481
00:51:36,847 --> 00:51:41,007
星を呼んで　位置を知るように
Calling upon the stars, as if to know my location,

482
00:51:41,227 --> 00:51:45,507
君の声で　僕は進めるんだ
With your voice, I can keep moving forward.

483
00:51:46,187 --> 00:51:52,667
さよならを言った場所から　離れても聞こえるよ　約束が
From the place where we said goodbye, even if far away, I can hear the promise.

484
00:52:21,247 --> 00:52:25,207
その胸にしまった日に憧れた
I longed for the day I tucked it away in my heart,

485
00:52:25,607 --> 00:52:30,027
こんな思い気づかなかったでしょう
Surely I never realized I'd feel this way.

486
00:52:30,247 --> 00:52:34,187
その日がその目に見えなくても
Even if that day is invisible to your eyes,

487
00:52:34,527 --> 00:52:38,467
この真夏の裏には夜空残る
The night sky remains behind this midsummer.

488
00:52:39,127 --> 00:52:46,627
さよならを言った場所には　君の声がずっと輝くんだ
In the place where we said goodbye, your voice keeps shining on forever.

489
00:52:46,927 --> 00:52:51,827
君が君を見失っても　僕が見つけ出せるよ
Even if you lose sight of yourself, I will find you.

490
00:52:55,747 --> 00:53:00,487
どんな今を生きていますか　僕の歌が今
What kind of present are you living in? Can my song now

491
