01:04:30,227 --> 01:04:34,827
星円です。星の炎と書いて「星円」です。
"Seien". Written with the kanji for star and flame, "Seien".

627
01:04:35,407 --> 01:04:43,927
実は今回のライブのタイトルにもなってます、「星円 Firefly Diva」。今回のセットリストも星と炎の曲で作られていて、
Actually, it's also the title of this live, "Seien Firefly Diva". The setlist is made up of songs about stars and flames,

628
01:04:44,467 --> 01:04:49,047
今回最後にこれからみわさんに作っていただいた「星円」を歌わせていただきます！
and finally, we will sing "Seien" which Miwa-san made for us!

629
01:04:49,487 --> 01:05:00,210
ニコたんがこうしてホロライブに来て、こうやってみわさんと出会ったり嬉しいこともたくさんありながらもやっぱり活動で悩んだりだとか辛いこととか…
Nikotan coming to Hololive, meeting Miwa-san like this, having many happy moments, but also struggling or facing hard times in activities...

630
01:05:00,335 --> 01:05:02,025
「と」とかそういうものがいっぱいあったんですけど
There were all sorts of things like 'to' and such,

631
01:05:02,205 --> 01:05:05,335
それを全部miwaさんに聴いてもらって、
and I had Miwa-san listen to all of them,

632
01:05:05,335 --> 01:05:07,955
あの歌詞をね、作っていただきました。
and she wrote the lyrics for me.

633
01:05:07,955 --> 01:05:10,725
曲も作っていただきました。本当に皆さん、ありがとうございます！
She composed the music for me too. Thank you all so very much!

634
01:05:11,225 --> 01:05:12,595
ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much!

635
01:05:12,935 --> 01:05:15,225
もう本当に光栄です。
I'm truly, truly honored.

636
01:05:15,555 --> 01:05:18,365
ねえ、ニコさんの曲一緒にかけれて本当に光栄です。
Hey, it's such an honor to sing Niko-san's song together.

637
01:05:18,515 --> 01:05:22,775
今日一緒に光を歌えて本当に嬉しかったです。本当にありがとうございます！
I was so happy to sing Hikari together today. Thank you so much!

638
01:05:22,965 --> 01:05:26,755
では、このあと歌う新曲「星炎」楽しみにしてるね。
Well, I'm looking forward to your upcoming new song 'Seien'.

639
01:05:26,945 --> 01:05:29,345
私もみんなと一緒にそこで見てるよ！
I'll be watching right there with everyone!

640
01:05:29,565 --> 01:05:31,505
ニコニコにいるのー！
I'll be right there on NicoNico!

641
01:05:32,355 --> 01:05:35,525
皆さんこれからもよろしくお願いします！よろしくお願いします！
Everyone, thank you for your continued support!

642
01:05:36,005 --> 01:05:37,995
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

643
01:05:37,995 --> 01:05:39,325
ありがとうございました！
Thank you very much!

644
01:05:40,225 --> 01:05:40,875
バイバーイ！
Bye-bye!

645
01:05:41,355 --> 01:05:41,805
がんばって！
Do your best!

646
01:05:42,315 --> 01:05:44,125
バイバーイ！
Bye-bye!

647
01:05:47,665 --> 01:05:55,545
あーもうmiwaさん可愛いし、作詞も素敵だし歌声も素晴らしいしもう本当に戻ったら永遠に語っちゃうな。
Ah, Miwa-san is so cute, her lyrics are wonderful, her singing voice is amazing... I could honestly talk about it forever if I went back.

648
01:05:56,445 --> 01:06:04,165
ってことで新曲を畳みにステージ移動したいと思います。聞いてください、「星炎」。
With that, I'd like to move to the stage to perform my new song. Please listen to 'Seien'.

649
01:06:33,663 --> 01:06:36,163
自信なんてなかった
I had no confidence,

650
01:06:36,163 --> 01:06:37,683
ひとりだってよかった
I was fine being alone.

651
01:06:37,683 --> 01:06:40,913
プライドに隠れて 誰かの視線
Hiding behind my pride, I cared too much

652
01:06:40,913 --> 01:06:45,103
気になってばかりで 閉じこもってた
about everyone's gaze and shut myself away.

653
01:06:49,463 --> 01:06:53,543
綺麗だなんて思えなくて
I couldn't think of myself as beautiful,

654
01:06:53,543 --> 01:06:57,093
笑えなかったんだ
and I couldn't smile.

655
01:06:57,093 --> 01:07:01,423
涙でにじんだ 画面の向こう
Beyond the screen blurred with tears,

656
01:07:01,423 --> 01:07:04,193
ふいに溶けた心
my heart suddenly melted.

657
01:07:04,193 --> 01:07:07,683
触れてくれた声
The voice that reached out to me,

658
01:07:07,683 --> 01:07:12,043
「君のおかげで笑えたよ」
"Because of you, I was able to smile."

659
01:07:12,043 --> 01:07:16,113
その言葉がずっと
Those words will forever

660
01:07:16,113 --> 01:07:20,363
この胸を灯す
light up this chest.

661
01:07:20,363 --> 01:07:24,243
ただ一つの光
My only light.

662
01:07:25,173 --> 01:07:28,213
Fire, take me higher 消えそうな声を歌に変えて
Fire, take me higher, turning this fading voice into a song,

663
01:07:28,213 --> 01:07:35,213
弱さ抱きしめながら 届けと叫ぶように
embracing my weakness, shouting so it will reach you,

664
01:07:35,213 --> 01:07:41,063
燃やす炎
burning like a flame.

665
01:07:41,493 --> 01:07:48,033
届けと叫ぶように 燃やす炎
Shouting so it reaches you, burning like a flame.

666
01:07:48,663 --> 01:07:53,003
Fire, take me higher

667
01:07:53,003 --> 01:07:57,173
君の明日を照らしたい
I want to illuminate your tomorrow.

668
01:08:05,633 --> 01:08:10,123
救われたくて 100以上出し切って
Wanting to be saved, giving it over 100%,

669
01:08:10,123 --> 01:08:13,553
疲れ果てた夜
on nights when I was exhausted,

670
01:08:13,553 --> 01:08:17,513
大事なものって なんだっけ
I'd start to forget what was truly important.

671
01:08:17,513 --> 01:08:19,703
忘れそうになるの
I'd start to forget what was truly important.

672
01:08:20,073 --> 01:08:24,163
振り返る足跡
Looking back at my footprints,

673
01:08:24,163 --> 01:08:28,373
あの頃の自分に会いたい
I want to meet the me of those days.

674
01:08:28,373 --> 01:08:32,283
もう戻れなくても
Even if I can never go back,

675
01:08:32,283 --> 01:08:36,243
素直になりたい
I want to be honest with myself.

676
01:08:36,243 --> 01:08:40,613
失くしたくないから
Because I don't want to lose it.

677
01:08:41,343 --> 01:08:44,213
Fire, take me higher 君への想い歌に乗せて
Fire, take me higher, putting my feelings for you into a song,

678
01:08:44,213 --> 01:08:51,213
恐さ受け止めながら 響けと祈るように
accepting my fears, praying that it resonates,

679
01:08:51,213 --> 01:08:56,783
燃やす炎
burning like a flame.

680
01:08:56,783 --> 01:09:03,773
響けと祈るように 燃やす炎
Praying that it resonates, burning like a flame.

681
01:09:04,353 --> 01:09:08,733
Fire, take me higher

682
01:09:08,733 --> 01:09:13,443
君の笑顔を灯したい
I want to light up your smile.

683
01:09:14,283 --> 01:09:18,383
壊れそうな夜をこえて
Crossing over nights that felt like they'd break,

684
01:09:18,383 --> 01:09:22,633
逃げ出したい朝をぬけて
slipping through mornings I wanted to run from,

685
01:09:22,633 --> 01:09:30,043
いまここにいる
I am right here now.

686
01:09:30,363 --> 01:09:34,213
私のつくる世界で
If you can smile in the world I create,

687
01:09:34,213 --> 01:09:38,463
君が笑ってくれるなら
If you can smile in the world I create,

688
01:09:38,753 --> 01:09:43,283
この声が生まれた理由
the reason this voice was born,

689
01:09:43,283 --> 01:09:47,223
胸に灯る星炎
is the star flame burning in my chest.

690
01:09:47,743 --> 01:09:51,863
Fire, take me higher

691
01:09:51,863 --> 01:09:59,253
私に意味をくれた君へ 声は届いていますか
To you who gave me meaning, are my words reaching you?

692
01:10:00,442 --> 01:10:01,342
Fire, take me higher

693
01:10:01,542 --> 01:10:02,318
私に意味をくれた君へ
To you who gave me meaning,

694
01:10:02,318 --> 01:10:03,218
声は届いてますか
Can you hear my voice?

695
01:10:03,218 --> 01:10:04,322
これからもずっと歩き続けたい
I want to keep walking on forever.

696
01:10:05,318 --> 01:10:07,718
Fire, take me higher

697
01:10:08,718 --> 01:10:12,418
消えそうな声を歌に変えて
Turning this fading voice into a song,

698
01:10:13,218 --> 01:10:16,218
弱さを抱き締めながら
While embracing my weaknesses,

699
01:10:17,018 --> 01:10:27,718
届けと叫ぶように燃やす炎
A burning flame, crying out to reach you.

700
01:10:28,718 --> 01:10:31,718
Fire, take me higher

701
01:10:33,218 --> 01:10:37,018
君の明日を照らしたい
I want to illuminate your tomorrow.

702
01:10:57,518 --> 01:11:01,218
皆さん歌を聴いてくれて、ありがとう！
Thank you everyone for listening to my song!

